@startuml
!include _style.iuml
skinparam BackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam classAttributeFontSize 18
skinparam classStereotypeFontSize 16
skinparam ArrowFontSize 17
skinparam NoteFontSize 17
skinparam LegendFontSize 15
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam nodesep 24
skinparam ranksep 30
hide circle
hide empty methods


top to bottom direction
title Strategic context map · as built
package "Media Management" $MEDIA {
 component "Asset / ownership / public view\nCommand adapters: enqueue_submit(), command()\n[ACL] apply_result(), public_job_schema()" as M
}
package "Processing" $PROC {
 component "Job / Attempt / cancellation gate\nTranslation: handle_command()\nState publication: emit_state()" as P
 component "Finite encoder roles\nworker.sqs / short_encoder" as E
 P -down-> E : work (internal)\nprocessing-work /\nprocessing-work-short
}
M -right-> P : submit / retry / cancel\nprocessing-commands [PL]
P -left-> M : result [PL] / media-results\nmodel dependency: Processing [U], Media [D]
legend bottom
  U/D = inferred result-model dependency; arrows = message flow. Media translates the upstream snapshot.
  [PL] Published Language = Envelope + Source in contracts/v1.py. Actor is API context.
  [ACL] = Media validation + mapping into its own projection/public states. Commands use adapters.
  Shared code is reused; no formal Customer/Supplier or Shared Kernel agreement is assumed.
  Conformist is not asserted: Media keeps its own model. delivery/ is shared technical code.
endlegend
@enduml
